# 1. Basic Plot

⚠️ Small mistake in your code:

```python
plt.lib(x,y)
```

should be:

```python
plt.plot(x,y)
```

### Correct Code

```python
x = [1,2,3,4]

y = [10,20,25,30]

plt.plot(x,y)

plt.show()
```

### Meaning

```text
x-axis → [1,2,3,4]

y-axis → [10,20,25,30]
```

Plot points:

```text
(1,10)
(2,20)
(3,25)
(4,30)
```

### Memory

```text
plot()
↓
Draw a line graph
```

