plt.xlabel("X-axis Label")

plt.ylabel("Y-axis Label")

plt.legend(["Dataset 1"])

plt.show()
```

---

### Meaning

Plots individual points.

```text
(1,10)

(2,12)

(3,25)

(4,30)

(5,45)
```

---

### Use Cases

```text
